285:0-85 "// Canon generates Go, C++ and TypeScript, never Lua. The bot scripts are Lua, so the" comment.line.double-slash.canon
286:0-75 "// plan reaches them through BotClient: a small binding (one function, e.g." comment.line.double-slash.canon
287:0-86 "// bot:loadData(path)) reads the JSON with nlohmann and pushes its `value` object (the" comment.line.double-slash.canon
288:0-85 "// record, SPEC §14.3) as a Lua table. Lua stays a consumer, never a target, and the" comment.line.double-slash.canon
289:0-52 "// script's `plan.combos[...]` code does not change." comment.line.double-slash.canon
